<title>USA: Muni bond day-to-day calendar totals $401 mln.</title>
<headline>Muni bond day-to-day calendar totals $401 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal bond underwriters have said they may price up to $401 million of municipal bonds next week, depending on market conditions, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>A total of 11 issues are on Reuters day-to-day negotiated calendar, meaning underwriters have said they may price the issues depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
